\label{sec:results}

All experiments use Qwen3-32B and the v1 prompt (\S\ref{sec:model}; Appendix~\ref{sec:appendix_prompts}) unless noted; cross-model validation covers Dimensions~1--2, while secondary analyses (error taxonomy, DocRED $R^2$, TOST) remain single-model.

